e refused; a generator's not started"] [242 1 "// closed; else the locals, cells, value stack, extra locals and f_trace dropped (frame_tp_clear), the code, globals,"] [243 1 "// builtins and f_back kept."] [269 1 "// FrameLocalsProxy is frame.f_locals of a function's frame (PEP 667; Objects/frameobject.c's PyFrameLocalsProxy_Type):"] [270 1 "// a mapping over the frame itself, reads and writes going to its fast locals and cells, so a write is seen by the"] [271 1 "// frame's code at its next load (the loop's and the compiled code's loads read f.Fast and f.Cells, never a copy:"] [272 1 "// survey \"Design: 219\"); a name none of the code's goes to the frame's extra locals."] [275 1 "// FrameLocalsProxyType is the proxy's type (\"FrameLocalsProxy\", registered as a Mapping by _collections_abc)."] [280 1 "// frameSlot is one of a code's names in co_localsplusnames' order: the fast locals (a parameter that is a cell read"] [281 1 "// through its cell), then the cells that are no parameter, then the free variables."] [284 18 "// the index in f.Fast or f.Cells, -1 for the other"] [285 18 "// an earlier slot has the name (each)"] [321 1 "// slotValue is s's value in f, nil when unbound."] [350 1 "// slotOf is framelocalsproxy_getkeyindex: the slot of key's name, an exact str by its text, else any key by its hash"] [351 1 "// and ==; read: only a bound one. -1 when none."] [403 1 "// set is framelocalsproxy_setitem (v nil: del): a local's slot written, never removed; else the extra locals."] [435 1 "// each calls fn on the bound names and their values in order, then the extra locals'. A name twice among the slots"] [436 1 "// (an inlined comprehension's own name in a fast slot beside the function's cell of that name, while the comprehension"] [437 1 "// runs: GH-128396's case, one slot in CPython holding the plain value) gives its first bound slot's value."] [463 1 "// dict is the proxy's items as a new dict (PyDict_Update(dict, proxy))."] [475 1 "// merge is framelocalsproxy_merge: other a dict or a proxy, each of its keys set; false for another mapping."] [575 2 "// nb_or: either operand the proxy, the result a dict of the left's items, then the right's"] [721 1 "// cIntArg is a C int argument: an int, OverflowError beyond 32 bits."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[12 23] [38 20] [66 25] [91 14] [91 24] [143 42] [158 28] [228 23] [231 25] [232 19] [232 29] [251 23] [252 25] [359 24] [369 22] [391 21] [392 26] [442 25] [444 14] [444 38] [452 19] [453 44] [478 39] [480 34] [485 26] [496 24] [509 35] [542 36] [549 31] [582 37] [589 25] [601 31] [608 41] [614 43] [622 42] [630 41] [636 49] [640 27] [640 34] [646 43] [691 40] [703 22] [704 26] [708 31]]} (go/file "tbobj.go" :imports [])

